{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20936","headline":"谢秀才有妾缟练改从於人秀才留之不得[後]生感忆座人制诗嘲谢贺复继四首 二 · 李贺","name":"谢秀才有妾缟练改从於人秀才留之不得[後]生感忆座人制诗嘲谢贺复继四首 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"铜镜立青鸾，燕脂拂紫绵。\n腮花弄暗粉，眼尾泪侵寒。\n碧玉破不复，瑶琴重拨弦。\n今日非昔日，何人敢正看。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李贺","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_20936.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20936","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}